upported Israel in the 2006 Israel-Lebanon war. Throughout his film","terminal_format_issue":"Format Agent is not selected as the Output Agent","topology_statistics":{"agent_count":0,"component_count":0,"directed_edge_count":0,"fan_in_agent_ids":[],"fan_out_agent_ids":[],"max_depth":0,"max_width":0,"output_agent_id":null,"quotient_directed_edge_count":0,"reciprocal_pair_count":0,"relation_count":0,"root_agent_ids":[],"root_component_count":0,"sink_agent_ids":[],"sink_component_count":0,"structural_depth":0,"topology_family":"empty","topology_motifs":[]}}","role":"user"},{"content":"{"action":"set_relation","source_id":"retriever","target_id":"synthesizer","source_to_target":true,"target_to_source":false}","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Canvas observation. Choose exactly one next action using only the task, messages, Canvas, catalog, and any supplied validated Skill facts.

