upported Israel in the 2006 Israel-Lebanon war. Throughout his film","terminal_format_issue":"Format Agent is not selected as the Output Agent","topology_statistics":{"agent_count":0,"component_count":0,"directed_edge_count":0,"fan_in_agent_ids":[],"fan_out_agent_ids":[],"max_depth":0,"max_width":0,"output_agent_id":null,"quotient_directed_edge_count":0,"reciprocal_pair_count":0,"relation_count":0,"root_agent_ids":[],"root_component_count":0,"sink_agent_ids":[],"sink_component_count":0,"structural_depth":0,"topology_family":"empty","topology_motifs":[]}}","role":"user"},{"content":"{"action":"add_agent","agent_id":"format","model_id":"qwen3.5-9b-local","contract":"Extract the conclusion from 'synthesizer' regarding the unavailability of Bruce Willis' real first name and serialize it as the final answer.","role_family":"format"}","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Canvas observation. Choose exactly one next action using only the task, messages, Canvas, catalog, and any supplied validated Skill facts.

